## Goal
Examine sample clustering and separation by experimental condition using principal component analysis (PCA) on gene-level counts. The six samples (three untreated, three treated) will be projected onto the first two principal components and visualized with condition-based coloring to assess how well treatments separate and the magnitude of replication variance.

